This distribution contains geographic data with separate terms:

* Natural Earth boundary, coastline and lake data are public domain.
* The Markermeer geometry is derived from OpenStreetMap data and is made
  available under the Open Database License (ODbL). Attribution to
  OpenStreetMap contributors is displayed in the radar card and retained in
  the bundled data file.

The MIT license in LICENSE applies to the SkyWatch Radar software, not to
these third-party geographic data terms.
